# S-15 — Checkout and order creation (#40–#42). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development, seed catalogue): all as expected.
# quote (prototype cart: course 350, print ×2 65, 5 seats smart-study, dedicated cooler) → 480.00 + 25.00 + 2100.00 =
#   2605.00 (the 11 §3.1 example), all lines ok · no cart → 409 checkout.cart_empty
# checkout: no Idempotency-Key → 400 idempotency.key_required · no name → 422 checkout.contact_required · terms false →
#   422 checkout.terms_not_accepted · bnpl → 400 validation.failed · expected 2600.00 → 409 checkout.price_changed
#   with quote · print line without address → 422 checkout.address_required · no bearer → 401
# success → 201 T3-26-001000 pending_payment, Location /v1/orders/T3-26-001000/status, statusToken st_…, payment
#   without redirect (NullPaymentInitiator); totals 480.00/25.00/2100.00/vat 0.00/2605.00, payment_due_at = +60 min,
#   4 order lines (sponsor line with its offer, intents sadaqa), dedication +9665… with a 22-char card token,
#   print stock_reserved +2, cart converted, address saved (saveAddress), profile name/email filled (RUL-25)
# same key + body → stored response, Idempotent-Replayed: true · same key, other body → 422 idempotency.key_reused
# RUL-13: adding the ordered course again → 409 cart.course_in_unpaid_order orderRef T3-26-001000
# RUL-30: last copy (available 1), two customers check out at once → one 201 T3-26-001001, one 409 checkout.out_of_stock
# RUL-27: vat_enabled → course 350.00 vat 45.65, print 65.00 vat 8.48, shipping 25.00 vat 3.26 → vatTotal 57.39
# status: bearer → full summary (next: open_course / track_shipment / view_giving, dedication card URL, documents []);
#   ?t= token → no dedications/documents; nothing → 401; wrong token → 404 order.not_found; unknown ref → 404
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1
@token = <customer access token>

### #40 Quote (cart cookie or bearer)
POST {{base}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### #41 Checkout
POST {{base}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: key-success-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"contact":{"fullName":"نورة العتيبي","email":"noura@example.com"},"isAnonymous":false,"shippingAddressId":null,
 "shippingAddress":{"recipientName":"نورة العتيبي","recipientMobile":"0551234567","city":"بريدة","district":"الريان",
 "shortAddress":"QBRA2929","street":"طريق الملك عبدالعزيز","buildingNo":"8123","postalCode":"52361"},"saveAddress":true,
 "paymentMethod":"mada","acceptTerms":true,"expectedGrandTotal":"2605.00","locale":"ar"}

### #41 Replay (same key and body) → same 201 body, Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{base}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: key-success-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"contact":{"fullName":"نورة العتيبي","email":"noura@example.com"},"isAnonymous":false,"shippingAddressId":null,
 "shippingAddress":{"recipientName":"نورة العتيبي","recipientMobile":"0551234567","city":"بريدة","district":"الريان",
 "shortAddress":"QBRA2929","street":"طريق الملك عبدالعزيز","buildingNo":"8123","postalCode":"52361"},"saveAddress":true,
 "paymentMethod":"mada","acceptTerms":true,"expectedGrandTotal":"2605.00","locale":"ar"}

### #42 Status with the bearer (full summary)
GET {{base}}/orders/T3-26-001000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### #42 Status with the status token only
GET {{base}}/orders/T3-26-001000/status?t=<statusToken>

### #42 Neither → 401
GET {{base}}/orders/T3-26-001000/status
